# Jak II with its multiplayer off in the launcher's Mods (sims: gkcfg-mpoff): the title's four rows, no Multiplayer
# (jak2_ptr_menu.sim is the five rows with it on, as it starts). The menu pointer on the title's menu (LIST-0.1.1 item
# 19; the owner: "i want the pointer to be able to interact with all menus"). Start, then A once the title is ready
# (as jak2_melee.sim), opens its menu; the right hand turns from high to low (the dot down the panel 1.6 m ahead), a
# shot each 5 degrees: the row under the dot is the one picked (highlighted). The dot goes 7.5 of the menu's units a
# degree, y 323.6 at 0 (b65). With four rows Quit Game is drawn at 257.5 to 304.5 (the hidden Secrets row's place
# taken up, as the game draws it: 0.1.3's boxes are where the rows are drawn; before, they were where the rows would
# be without that, 45 lower, and this script's 0 degrees "worked" on a Quit Game that was not drawn there): at 0
# degrees the dot is under the menu. Then the dot on Quit Game (6 degrees) and the trigger: its Yes / No line comes up
# under it (its middle 301.5, the dot on it within 18). Then at 5, 3 and 1 degrees the dot to the left half (12
# degrees: Yes) and the right half (-4: No), a shot each, and last the trigger on No at 3, which closes the question
# (a click on Yes would quit the game).
2400 menu 1
2406 menu 0
2900 a 1
2906 a 0
3100 shot jm-main
3120 hand_pitch 30
3150 shot jm-p30
3160 hand_pitch 25
3190 shot jm-p25
3200 hand_pitch 20
3230 shot jm-p20
3240 hand_pitch 15
3270 shot jm-p15
3280 hand_pitch 10
3310 shot jm-p10
3320 hand_pitch 5
3350 shot jm-p5
3360 hand_pitch 0
3390 shot jm-p0
3400 hand_pitch -10
3430 shot jm-pm10
3440 hand_pitch 6
3470 shot jm-p6
3500 right_trigger 1
3506 right_trigger 0
3560 shot jm-exit-asked
3565 hand_pitch 5
3570 hand_yaw 12
3600 shot jm-exit-5-yes
3610 hand_yaw -4
3640 shot jm-exit-5-no
3645 hand_pitch 3
3650 hand_yaw 12
3680 shot jm-exit-3-yes
3690 hand_yaw -4
3720 shot jm-exit-3-no
3725 hand_pitch 1
3730 hand_yaw 12
3760 shot jm-exit-1-yes
3770 hand_yaw -4
3800 shot jm-exit-1-no
3805 hand_pitch 3
3820 right_trigger 1
3826 right_trigger 0
3880 shot jm-exit-closed
3920 quit 0
